{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02364",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.77,
      "end_seconds": 4.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, uh, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.69,
      "end_seconds": 10.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Alright, yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.81,
      "end_seconds": 20.64,
      "duration_seconds": 7.83,
      "text": "Okay, so I wanted to get a chronic cough with lots of phlegm looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.66,
      "end_seconds": 25.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.54,
      "end_seconds": 32.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "It's been going on for about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.42,
      "end_seconds": 43.72,
      "duration_seconds": 10.3,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.06,
      "end_seconds": 54.81,
      "duration_seconds": 9.75,
      "text": "It's a few times a day. Only chest physio, and it's not much. About a three out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.49,
      "end_seconds": 58.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.15,
      "end_seconds": 69.39,
      "duration_seconds": 9.24,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get tiredness as well. The tiredness? That's been for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.85,
      "end_seconds": 72.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Ah. Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.91,
      "end_seconds": 85.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.1,
      "end_seconds": 117.19,
      "duration_seconds": 10.09,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 15, BP is 128 over 69, temperature is 36.9 degrees, heart rate 83, oxygen saturation is 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.32,
      "end_seconds": 119.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.11,
      "end_seconds": 123.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "We'll look at it together shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.84,
      "end_seconds": 130.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.16,
      "end_seconds": 140.1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.07,
      "end_seconds": 143.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.98,
      "end_seconds": 158.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "There are coarse crackles at both bases and the fingers are slightly clubbed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.19,
      "end_seconds": 172.77,
      "duration_seconds": 8.58,
      "text": "Alright, good, you can sit up again. A few quick ones: weight loss, fever or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.52,
      "end_seconds": 179.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Yeah, no, no weight loss, fever or chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.25,
      "end_seconds": 183.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Okay, and your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.76,
      "end_seconds": 186.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.73,
      "end_seconds": 192.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.5,
      "end_seconds": 196.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "No, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.4,
      "end_seconds": 211.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.29,
      "end_seconds": 217.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "No, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.69,
      "end_seconds": 234.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Okay, has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.85,
      "end_seconds": 240.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "I'm allergic to kiwi, I get an itchy mouth."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.74,
      "end_seconds": 259.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.53,
      "end_seconds": 264.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.82,
      "end_seconds": 268.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.29,
      "end_seconds": 273.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.59,
      "end_seconds": 287.55,
      "duration_seconds": 12.96,
      "text": "Putting it all together, I think we're dealing with a flare of bronchiectasis at this stage. I'm sending you for a sputum culture because of purulent sputum."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.27,
      "end_seconds": 290.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "That's fine with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.84,
      "end_seconds": 328.87,
      "duration_seconds": 37.03,
      "text": "I'm sending you for a chest X-ray because of bronchiectasis flare. I'll start you on clarithromycin, 500 milligrams, twice a day, fourteen days. You take it by mouth. It's for bronchiectasis flare. Keep up your airway clearance exercises twice a day. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. I'd like you to see the respiratory clinic as well, and I'll write the referral."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.65,
      "end_seconds": 335.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "Come back in two weeks. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.7,
      "end_seconds": 340.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}